      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes. It's so frustrating to have to hide or show everything via \"show avatar\". Even if i can specify \"hide lights\" or \"hide animations\" *per person* that's still more powerful than \"make everyone except friends + 'shown avatars' go to fallback.\" (Especially because in 80 person lobbies, friends often change avatars once or twice so I'd rather the safety settings auto hide individual components on them based on performance, rather than being locked into \"show avatar\")",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
