      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also, add avatar download size and performance rank in the Safety Settings for each Trust Rank. Every time I'm in the mood to tolerate lower FPS for more immersion I have to change the download size in the large menu settings (which means more extra steps). I want to download my Friends 150mb avatar without having to show them individually one by one.\n\nI want to show Very Poor Avatars to my Friends and Trust Rank and show avatars for Lower Ranks but only if they are not Very Poor.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
