      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "tbh I see no much sense in the ranks at all.\n\nFor years from sep 2018 when those ranks were added I never understood how purple \"trusted users\" are more trusted than regular green users or something in terms of performance. They all roughly the same.\n\nIn terms of content too. I only seen disturbing content from some visitors/new users but green Users and higher also roughly the same and rarely do shit, but if do both equally.",
