      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a9fe9983955314156acc4f7|full_name} I think it's a holdover from when avatar performance was a trusted thing, because of how many people would abuse avatars to spam shaders or whatever in public instances. It was much more of a wild west and we didn't have the personal controls that we do now.",
